odal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="a-trusted-courier-service" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--standard" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container--image-right landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995ee13.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C70%2C8192%2C5325&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C70%2C8192%2C5325&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zdE5bqstJ9-inh_EVRI_LOCATION_05_7995.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C70%2C8192%2C5325&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="View from the window of a house, an Evri courier is approaching and waving to a woman in the window. He is delivering a couple of parcels to the house." width="2000" height="1300" class="landing-feature-banner__image landing-feature-banner__image--image-right" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--image-right landing-feature-banner__content--standard landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>A trusted courier service</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--standard landing-feature-banner__rich-text--padding" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Providing our full range of benefits when you send on a Sunday<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->For no additional cost, you and your recipient can enjoy numerous incredible benefits when sending a parcel with Evri compared to other couriers. Discover outstanding delivery with benefits such as: <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->End-to-end parcel tracking on our app or online <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A 1-hour delivery window, so you know when to expect your courier <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Divert your parcel to a ParcelShop or Locker for peace of mind <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Give your courier delivery instructions by nominating a neighbour or safe place <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Accessibility features for our disabled customers to customise their delivery <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Up to three delivery attempts with no charge for a missed delivery <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->£20 parcel cover completely free (excluding postable) <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><!--]--></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__button-wrapper" data-v-54256dfc><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-primary e-button--variant-3 e-button--icon-right e-button--link landing-feature-banner__button landing-feature-banner__button--standard" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/evri-reviews" data-v-54256dfc style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Check out our reviews to see why customers love us<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></section><section id="our-parcel-drop-off-network-is-open-7-days-a-week" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral conditional-section-wrapper" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="default-slice" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our parcel drop off network is open 7 days a week<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You&#39;re never far from one of our convenient ParcelShop or Locker locations. Find out how you can take advantage of our drop off network on a Sunday: <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container--2cols article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3194a3f4.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3194.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=30%2C0%2C4564%2C3035&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3194.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=30%2C0%2C4564%2C3035&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJXZbqstJ9-TgB_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3194.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=30%2C0%2C4564%2C3035&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="ParcelShop store assistant is standing at the till and smiling, posing for the photo." width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShops – open on Sundays <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Almost all of our ParcelShops are open 7 days a week with long opening hours and free nearby parking. With over 9,000 locations now available in UK communities, it has never been more convenient to send, return or collect an Evri parcel. Once you’ve booked your parcel online, you can even print your label in-store with one of our handy Print-in-ParcelShop devices.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Visit your local ParcelShop-open Visit your local ParcelShop page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/find-a-parcelshop" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Visit your local ParcelShop<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058bdec.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6THgpbqstJ9-Tdi_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3058.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Customer standing outside with a blue Evri Locker in the background. They are holding a parcel and smiling for the photo." width="1000" height="665" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Find your 24/7 parcel Locker <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Available 24 hours a day, 7 days a week, our Lockers are secure, easy to use, and always open for business. You can find Evri lockers in neighbourhoods across the country, with constant plans to grow our network. Enjoy a seamless and automated parcel drop-off experience this weekend by sending a parcel with a Locker.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Find your nearest Locker-open Find your nearest Locker page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/find-a-parcelshop" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Find your nearest Locker<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="flexible-return-options-on-sunday" data-slice="FeatureBanner" class="feature-banner feature-banner--pt-0" index="5" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__container" data-v-054940bd><div class="feature-banner__content" data-v-054940bd><!----><h2 class="feature-banner__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-054940bd>Flexible return options on Sunday</h2><div class="feature-banner__text" data-v-054940bd><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Got a return to make with no time to lose? Well, just because it’s Sunday, doesn’t mean you’ve got to wait. You can process your return on our website and then head straight down to your local ParcelShop to get your items on the move. Our super-fast and super-simple tool allows you to browse from a vast number of retailers to get a label for your parcel in no time. Don’t let the weekend delay your returns.  <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><button data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-3 e-button--icon-right feature-banner__button" data-gtm-track="button-Make your return this Sunday" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href data-v-054940bd style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Make your return this Sunday<!--]--></span></button></div><div class="feature-banner__image" 